          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "b",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>(1-2) Helpers, 8. A mason, 5.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(3-4) A meal, 1\u00bd. A crowbar, \u00bc. A carpenter, 3</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(5-7) Supervision, three days, 6. A ladder, \u00be.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>On the 6th of Adar 127:</li>\n<li>(9-12) A meal, 2. A mason, 5. The helpers, 12. Supervision, 2.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(13-15) \u2026. Renting \u2026. the room of Asad, 12.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(16-17) A meal, 2. Three helpers, 12.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>(18-23) A ladder \u2026. The ladder, \u00bc. A mason, 5. Supervision \u2026. n\u0101sh\u016bsh \u2026. Clay, 3\u2026.</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li>\n<li>\u00a0</li></ol>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
